#: ../../components/surrogate.md:79
msgid ""
"Adapters for BoTorch/SMT surrogates, beyond scikit-"
"learn/XGBoost/LightGBM/PyTorch, are not currently implemented in "
"`saealib`. `pyproject.toml` has no corresponding extra either. pymoo has "
"adapters, but at the "
"[Problem](problem.md)/[Crossover](crossover.md)/[Mutation](mutation.md)/[Algorithm](algorithm.md)"
" level, not as a `Surrogate` — pymoo doesn't provide surrogate models."
msgstr ""
"scikit-"
"learn/XGBoost/LightGBM/PyTorch以外のBoTorch/SMTサロゲートアダプタは、現状`saealib`に実装されていません。"
" `pyproject.toml`にも対応するextraはありません。 "
"pymooにはアダプタがありますが、これは`Surrogate`としてではなく[Problem](problem.md)/[Crossover](crossover.md)/[Mutation](mutation.md)/[Algorithm](algorithm.md)のレベルです——pymooはサロゲートモデルを提供していません。"

