#: ../../components/surrogate.md:86
msgid ""
"If you just want to add post-fit processing, you can add it to an "
"existing `Surrogate` instance with `with_post_fit(fn)` instead of "
"creating a new subclass. `with_post_fit` doesn't modify the original "
"instance — it returns a copy with `fn` added."
msgstr ""
"フィット後の後処理だけを足したい場合、サブクラスを新設せずに`with_post_fit(fn)`で既存の`Surrogate`インスタンスへ処理を追加できます。"
" `with_post_fit`は元のインスタンスを変更せず、`fn`を追加したコピーを返します。"

#: ../../components/surrogate.md:101
msgid "`fn`'s signature is `fn(train_x, train_y, ctx) -> None`."
msgstr "`fn`のシグネチャは`fn(train_x, train_y, ctx) -> None`です。"

#: ../../components/surrogate.md:103
msgid "Implementing a custom Surrogate"
msgstr "独自Surrogateの実装方法"

#: ../../components/surrogate.md:105
msgid ""
"If you need a custom predictive model, subclass `Surrogate` and implement"
" `fit()`/`predict()`. Choose `RegressionSurrogate` for regression, or "
"`ComparisonSurrogate` (implementing `predict_proba()`) for comparison, as"
" the class to subclass."
msgstr ""
"独自の予測モデルが必要な場合は、`Surrogate`を継承して`fit()`/`predict()`を実装します。 "
"回帰なら`RegressionSurrogate`、比較なら`ComparisonSurrogate`（`predict_proba()`を実装）を継承先に選びます。"

